<title>USA: Whitehall says to boost number of shares.</title>
<headline>Whitehall says to boost number of shares.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whitehall Corp said on Monday that its shareholders voted to increase the number of authorized shares to 20 million from five million.</p>
<p>The increase was a condition to implement the two-for-one stock split declared on January 29, 1997, the company said. The additional shares will be mailed to shareholders on or about April 15, 1997, Whitehall said.</p>
<p>Whitehall currently has 2.75 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
